  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy Infrastructure Recovery and Acceleration of the Green Energy Transition in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to modernize Ukraine&apos;s energy sector infrastructure for enhanced generation capacity and green technologies. This will be achieved through the provision of biogas ready gas pistons, auxiliary equipment, technical and logistical support, installation of the equipment as well as quality assurance for sustainability. The project will result in increased generation and maneuvering capacities.</narrative>
